&lt;p&gt;Start your semester with great coffee and even better conversations at &lt;em&gt;Grad Networking: A Caf&amp;eacute; Connection&lt;/em&gt;&amp;mdash;a coffee-themed speed-friending event designed to help you meet fellow&amp;nbsp;graduate students&amp;nbsp;and form meaningful connections. This casual mixer is the perfect way to expand your network, whether you&amp;rsquo;re new to campus or a returning student.&lt;/p&gt;
