&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.socacenternyc.org%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cpk2851%40cumc.columbia.edu%7C43073c3cbcc24141b16e08dde00d2689%7Cb0002a9b0017404d97dc3d3bab09be81%7C0%7C0%7C638913069643339092%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=UK1tSrfJ4QKG8gAn%2FhZh9xRVs%2BcH623FFu5iFxR%2BU24%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0" target="_blank"&gt;Center of Social&amp;nbsp;Captial&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(SoCa)&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.socacenternyc.org%2Fprojectscholar&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cpk2851%40cumc.columbia.edu%7C43073c3cbcc24141b16e08dde00d2689%7Cb0002a9b0017404d97dc3d3bab09be81%7C0%7C0%7C638913069643367322%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=NH2QWnq7BSFvZssPzEw6NEpumZBUY2Ty4U281IPg1KI%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0" target="_blank"&gt;Early Scholars Program&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;is sponsoring participation in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ncfdd.org%2Fabout-us&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cpk2851%40cumc.columbia.edu%7C43073c3cbcc24141b16e08dde00d2689%7Cb0002a9b0017404d97dc3d3bab09be81%7C0%7C0%7C638913069643387086%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=CPysmRcE6e6NBZODRp%2B%2FKdoaDitbH5Vgh4Enyu51hdU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0" target="_blank"&gt;National Center for Faculty Development &amp;amp; Diversity&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;workshop,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Every Semester Needs a Plan&lt;/em&gt;, this September. This workshop is open to all academic individuals who are interested in gaining valuable strategies for the semester for setting personal and professional goals, developing a strategic plan